{"type":"message","id":"e92fe4eb","parentId":"8b0cfa76","timestamp":"2026-02-01T23:12:21.022Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_012qhPTX1gh8cjLtR7qxSR8M","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/scripts/scout-joc-wrapper.sh","content":"#!/bin/bash\n# Scout JOC Lead Scraper Wrapper\n# Usage: ./scripts/scout-joc-wrapper.sh\n\nset -euo pipefail\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/..\"\n\necho \"🚀 Starting JOC Lead Scraper — $(date -u +%Y-%m-%d)\"\nnode scripts/scout-joc-leads.js \"$@\"\necho \"✅ Done — $(date -u +%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S UTC)\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":207,"cacheRead":13850,"cacheWrite":5159,"totalTokens":19217,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.005175,"cacheRead":0.006925,"cacheWrite":0.03224375,"total":0.04434875}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769987536940}}
{"type":"message","id":"f2bbee93","parentId":"e92fe4eb","timestamp":"2026-02-01T23:12:21.033Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_012qhPTX1gh8cjLtR7qxSR8M","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 275 bytes to /home/ec2-user/clawd/scripts/scout-joc-wrapper.sh"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769987541032}}
{"type":"message","id":"95d45be4","parentId":"f2bbee93","timestamp":"2026-02-01T23:12:28.505Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_016oyqNztBMm7hF8bKCqspzJ","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/scout/SETUP.md","content":"# Scout Agent — Setup\n\n## JOC Lead Scraper\n\nSearches for publicly awarded Job Order Contracting (JOC) contracts and builds a lead list.\n\n### Run\n\n```bash\n# Direct\nnode scripts/scout-joc-leads.js\n\n# Via wrapper\nbash scripts/scout-joc-wrapper.sh\n\n# With custom API key\nBRAVE_API_KEY=your_key node scripts/scout-joc-leads.js\n```\n\n### Output\n\nReports go to `agents/scout/reports/`:\n- `joc-leads-YYYY-MM-DD.json` — Raw structured leads\n- `joc-leads-YYYY-MM-DD.csv` — CRM-importable CSV\n- `joc-leads-YYYY-MM-DD.md` — Formatted markdown report\n\n### Config\n\n- Brave API key: auto-reads from `~/.clawdbot/clawdbot.json` or `BRAVE_API_KEY` env var\n- 15 search queries, ~150 page fetches max\n- Rate limited: 1s between searches, 600ms between page fetches\n\n### Integration\n\n```js\nconst { run } = require('./scripts/scout-joc-leads');\nconst { leads, summary } = await run();\n```\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":381,"cacheRead":19009,"cacheWrite":247,"totalTokens":19638,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.009525,"cacheRead":0.009504499999999999,"cacheWrite":0.00154375,"total":0.02057825}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769987541034}}
