{"type":"message","id":"1caced14","parentId":"90244bc2","timestamp":"2026-02-01T23:21:53.818Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Task Complete\n\n**Built and tested the JOC contractor lead scraper.** Here's what was created:\n\n### Files Created:\n1. **`scripts/scout-joc-leads.js`** — Main scraper (Node.js, no dependencies)\n2. **`scripts/scout-joc-wrapper.sh`** — Shell wrapper\n3. **`agents/scout/SETUP.md`** — Documentation\n4. **`agents/scout/reports/joc-leads-2026-02-01.json`** — 79 leads (49KB)\n5. **`agents/scout/reports/joc-leads-2026-02-01.csv`** — CSV export (13KB)\n6. **`agents/scout/reports/joc-leads-2026-02-01.md`** — Formatted report (36KB)\n\n### Test Run Results:\n- **79 contracts found** across 15 Brave searches\n- **37 unique contractors** identified (42/79 had some contractor signal)\n- **22 unique agencies** identified\n- **60 pages fetched**, 19 skipped (timeouts/PDFs/login walls)\n- Brave API key auto-read from `~/.clawdbot/clawdbot.json`\n\n### Notes:\n- Regex-based extraction is v1 quality — contractor names especially need refinement (pulls sentence fragments sometimes). Works best as signal/lead gen, not clean data.\n- Script is importable: `const { run } = require('./scripts/scout-joc-leads')`\n- Rate-limited: 1.1s between searches, 600ms between fetches, 10s hard timeout per page\n- Fixed a tricky Node.js `http.get` issue where hanging responses would block the event loop — added hard timeouts on all fetches"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":424,"cacheRead":45242,"cacheWrite":171,"totalTokens":45838,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.0106,"cacheRead":0.022621,"cacheWrite":0.00106875,"total":0.03429475}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1769988102517}}
